This experiment develops a multimodal Visual Question Answering (VQA) system that accepts an image and a natural-language question. The system uses a vision-enabled LLM to analyze the image and generate an answer based on its visual content.

Technologies: Python, Ollama, Llama 3.2 Vision

Workflow:
Input Image
     ↓
Image Processing
     ↓
Vision LLM
     ↓
Question Analysis
     ↓
Visual Understanding
     ↓
Generated Answer

Objective:
To understand how multimodal AI models can process images and answer questions about their visual content.
